	(text "ICHOP = 2.75 V * TORQUE / (256 * ISGAIN * RSENSE) (SLVSC40H eq. 1).\nISGAIN 10, RSENSE 0.1 ohm, TORQUE 186: 2.00 A per phase (derived);\nTORQUE 255 gives 2.74 A, the ceiling. Firmware limits TORQUE to 186 (HW-MOT-002).\nVSENSE 0.2 V at 2 A, under the 0.7 V xISENx rating (6.1). P = 0.2 W rms in a 1 W 2512.\nCSD18543Q3A: 60 V, Qg 11.1 nC (SLPS633). C306/C307 at each bridge's high side.\nRT301 sits next to the FETs: 10k NTC from +3V3 / 10k, read by the ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 189.23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "353ee6b6-ec04-5d94-aceb-c9d4a4d69ff0")
	)
	(text "H-bridges and current sense"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 212.09 19.05 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "569a5c4b-7f91-511b-b76b-85031f40b092")
	)
	(text "Pin Functions (SLVSC40H 5): CP1-CP2 0.1 uF rated > VM; VCP 1 uF to VM; V5 0.1 uF; VINT 1 uF;\nVM 0.01 uF + bulk (sheet 2); BEMF 1 nF low-leakage; SDATO, FAULTn, STALLn open drain: pull-ups.\nLogic VIH 1.5 V (6.5): 3.3 V MCU drives it directly. BIN1/BIN2 unused in indexer mode: tied to GND.\nR306 holds SLEEPn low (outputs off) until the MCU drives it.\nBEMF -> ADC through 10k/20k: 5 V -> 3.33 V (derived); ASSUMPTION: BEMF output <= V5 and drives 30 kohm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b7dd6cb0-0e55-58d6-81c5-1f6d1f42174e")
	)
